description:
Design a digit display decoder for a 7-segment display. The module takes a 4-bit input (T) representing a decimal digit (0-15) and outputs a 7-bit signal (C) to control the segments of the display. If the input 's' is high, the module decodes the binary value of T to the corresponding 7-segment display configuration, representing numbers 0-9 and some hexadecimal characters (A-F). If 's' is low, all segments are turned off, except for one which is left on.
module top_module(
    input [3:0] T,
    output reg [6:0] C,
    input s
    );

