description:
Design a circuit that implements a double NAND operation followed by a direct output. The module takes two single-bit inputs, a and b, computes the first NAND output from these inputs, then applies the NAND operation to the result of the first NAND with itself, effectively creating a NOT operation on the first output. The final output is the result of this second operation, which functions as a logical NOT of a NAND gate on inputs a and b.
module top_module(
    input a,
    input b,
    output reg out
);

